<title>USA: SunAmerica Inc offers 10.7 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>SunAmerica Inc offers 10.7 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunAmerica Inc said Monday that it is offering 10,669,745 shares of its common stock from its shelf registration statement through Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>SunAmerica is a diversified financial services company specializing in retirement savings and investment products and services.</p>
</text>
